{"id":"f8889c75147aefcfdd43553debeaaf2923a0b7d0","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1247516","title":"claude 使用新方法","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"syyyyy","excerpt":"Claude - @syyyyy - 在 grok bot 的云电脑里安装 tailscale ，orca,claude 。全程只和 grok bot 对话，让 grok bot 去用英文指挥 claude 干活。grok bot 连接谷","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div><p>在 grok bot 的云电脑里安装 tailscale ，orca,claude 。全程只和 grok bot 对话，让 grok bot 去用英文指挥 claude 干活。grok bot 连接谷歌或者微软云盘。文件交接放在这。暂时没被 a/封</p></div><div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162241\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/54da4261eefc045fe1031e161b6caa5a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ddczl\" data-uid=\"635032\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ddczl\">ddczl</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 09:45:41 +08:00\">16h 3m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 9</span>\n                    \n                    <p>没必要，真的没必要，降一档使用 Codex 也没什么不好。<br>别说什么 GPT 能力不如 Claude ，千金难买我开心，就跟谈恋爱一样，没必要死缠烂打。<br>自从封我号以后，claude 的网页我都没再打开过了，给钱当重孙子，我是当不来。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162253\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7b1432fd9577a14116e3971df74c876b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"giter\" data-uid=\"476845\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/giter\">giter</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 09:47:53 +08:00\">16h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/ddczl\">ddczl</a> 你的话未免太绝对了，等你用 GPT 蹬不尽兴，或者发现 GPT 真是又蠢又慢的时候，你又会想起 Claude 这个小甜甜的好了，即使现在 Claude 过于牛夫人了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162423\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b2b9/26d5/253118_normal.png?m=1781944325\" alt=\"huanxianghao\" data-uid=\"253118\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/huanxianghao\">huanxianghao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 10:12:31 +08:00\">15h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你没长时间用过吧？ Grok Bot 带的虚拟机，经常重置、失联，tailscale 经常断开<br>我开始也是这样，后来我直接自己找了正规的服务器让 grok 在上面运行</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162568\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b469cdf6ccf6416b61762323197584cc?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"syyyyy\" data-uid=\"626364\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/syyyyy\">syyyyy</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 10:31:55 +08:00\">15h 17m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/huanxianghao\">huanxianghao</a> 简单来说就是 grok bot 更新云电脑会把一些配置，文件清掉。在其他文件夹做一个恢复脚本就行，丢失对主 bot 说一声让它跑恢复脚本就行</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162696\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/951619fa9f479b2e971c81008c8afbe8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"pdc\" data-uid=\"590195\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/pdc\">pdc</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 10:49:23 +08:00\">15h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用 kiro 渠道代理，使用 claude code 不封号</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162797\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a97d/a629/107_normal.png?m=1764291462\" alt=\"ratazzi\" data-uid=\"107\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ratazzi\">ratazzi</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 11:06:32 +08:00\">14h 43m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>我现在两个 Pro 账号，上午 Melbourne 下午 Paris</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18163163\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9957/cdcc/347966_normal.png?m=1787302070\" alt=\"xyooyx\" data-uid=\"347966\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xyooyx\">xyooyx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 12:14:45 +08:00\">13h 34m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>感觉 grok bot 的 IP 巨脏无比，cf 风控必中</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18163244\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a64e/47f6/593045_normal.png?m=1783662829\" alt=\"alexluo1\" data-uid=\"593045\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/alexluo1\">alexluo1</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 12:55:26 +08:00\">12h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没这个必要，你的付款方式+IP+账单地址最好能对应上，否则什么都不好使</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18163309\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fa70/42da/194163_normal.png?m=1749184790\" alt=\"potatowish\" data-uid=\"194163\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/potatowish\">potatowish</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 13:25:11 +08:00\">12h 24m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这和远程海外 macmini ，直接在服务器上用是一样的，而且你这个特征更加明显</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18163374\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c01a9990e9f1bcbea1b8b6e4b0ed12f6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kuhung\" data-uid=\"239959\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kuhung\">kuhung</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 13:40:22 +08:00\">12h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>grokbot 的属性、行为特征太明显了，感觉要稳定运行一周以上才能确切说行。况且这么做的人多了之后，异常特征就更明显了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18163389\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2b6a/6642/158839_normal.png?m=1651915197\" alt=\"ersic\" data-uid=\"158839\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ersic\">ersic</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 13:44:29 +08:00\">12h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>跟弄个独立的 vps 运行有什么分别？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18163392\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 13:45:12 +08:00\">12h 4m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/giter\">giter</a> codex 真是越来越蠢了，都想退订换 grok 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18163451\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2aadd08fc12d1da753775aa0e381289b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yjiefl\" data-uid=\"559015\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yjiefl\">yjiefl</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 13:56:34 +08:00\">11h 53m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不是自己的设备用着不顺。云服务器不可靠。gpt 要涨价。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18163885\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/51d35353d2ae93215a7ee9e7e20abe55?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"skuuhui\" data-uid=\"687707\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/skuuhui\">skuuhui</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 15:13:42 +08:00\">10h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你把你的 claude 对话记录随便导出一段出来。随便找个 chat 模型。问他你最可能是哪个国家人。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18164631\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/612b/2735/130165_normal.png?m=1786797253\" alt=\"akring\" data-uid=\"130165\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/akring\">akring</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 17:39:21 +08:00\">8h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/xyooyx\">xyooyx</a> Grok bot 的 ip 注册 Apple ID 可能都不让</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18165207\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b2b9/26d5/253118_normal.png?m=1781944325\" alt=\"huanxianghao\" data-uid=\"253118\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/huanxianghao\">huanxianghao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 22:12:02 +08:00\">3h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/syyyyy\">syyyyy</a> #7 就是用起来不省心，突然就失联了，然后又要重新唤起，久而久之就烦了。开始我很推崇 Grok Bot ，因为它好几天才重置一次，基本不影响。现在重置越来越频繁，盲猜用的人多了，服务降级了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18165435\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5fe9/12f1/194978_normal.png?m=1788093749\" alt=\"IC0ZB\" data-uid=\"194978\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/IC0ZB\">IC0ZB</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-11 00:51:32 +08:00\">58 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>换模型换的勤，最后啥也没做出来。智能其实也没差多少，又不是让你去搞哥德巴赫猜想。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"在 grok bot 的云电脑里安装 tailscale ，orca,claude 。全程只和 grok bot 对话，让 grok bot 去用英文指挥 claude 干活。grok bot 连接谷歌或者微软云盘。文件交接放在这。暂时没被 a/封 1 ddczl 16h 3m ago 9 没必要，真的没必要，降一档使用 Codex 也没什么不好。别说什么 GPT 能力不如 Claude ，千金难买我开心，就跟谈恋爱一样，没必要死缠烂打。自从封我号以后，claude 的网页我都没再打开过了，给钱当重孙子，我是当不来。 2 giter 16h 1m ago @ddczl 你的话未免太绝对了，等你用 GPT 蹬不尽兴，或者发现 GPT 真是又蠢又慢的时候，你又会想起 Claude 这个小甜甜的好了，即使现在 Claude 过于牛夫人了。 4 huanxianghao 15h 37m ago 你没长时间用过吧？ Grok Bot 带的虚拟机，经常重置、失联，tailscale 经常断开我开始也是这样，后来我直接自己找了正规的服务器让 grok 在上面运行 7 syyyyy OP 15h 17m ago via iPhone @huanxianghao 简单来说就是 grok bot 更新云电脑会把一些配置，文件清掉。在其他文件夹做一个恢复脚本就行，丢失对主 bot 说一声让它跑恢复脚本就行 8 pdc 15h 0m ago 用 kiro 渠道代理，使用 claude code 不封号 10 ratazzi PRO 14h 43m ago 1 我现在两个 Pro 账号，上午 Melbourne 下午 Paris 11 xyooyx 13h 34m ago 1 感觉 grok bot 的 IP 巨脏无比，cf 风控必中 12 alexluo1 PRO 12h 54m ago 没这个必要，你的付款方式+IP+账单地址最好能对应上，否则什么都不好使 13 potatowish 12h 24m ago via iPhone 这和远